<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="tblisonb's apps" pubkey="" timestamp="1794055831" url="https://tblisonb.github.io/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Segue, a music player, and MediaSync, version control for your music, photos, videos and games. The same signed APKs as the GitHub releases of github.com/tblisonb/Segue and github.com/tblisonb/MediaSync.</description></repo><application id="com.tlisonbee.mediasync"><id>com.tlisonbee.mediasync</id><added>2026-11-05</added><lastupdated>2026-11-07</lastupdated><name>MediaSync</name><summary>Keeps your phone's music, photos, videos and games in sync with your own server</summary><desc>The Android app of MediaSync, self-hosted version control for your music, photos, videos and games. One PC runs the MediaSync server and holds the library; the phone keeps a copy of the folders you pick, in sync with it, over your own Tailscale network.

* Every change (a retag, a rename, a deleted file) is a revision you can look at and undo, and nothing changes on the phone until you've seen what's coming.
* Music is filed by its tags, the same on every device, and a retag only sends the new tags.
* The camera's photos can be backed up to the server, filed by date.
* Movies, shows and games: the phone keeps only the ones you pick for it.

Needs the MediaSync server (github.com/tblisonb/MediaSync), Tailscale, and &quot;All files access&quot;.</desc><license>GPL-3.0-or-later</license><categories>Multimedia,Connectivity</categories><category>Multimedia</category><web>https://github.com/tblisonb/MediaSync</web><source>https://github.com/tblisonb/MediaSync</source><tracker>https://github.com/tblisonb/MediaSync/issues</tracker><changelog>https://github.com/tblisonb/MediaSync/releases</changelog><author>tblisonb</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>26</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeDep</antifeatures><package><version>1.4.0</version><versioncode>26</versioncode><apkname>mediasync-1.4.0.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">dbf93c703b1449607bc6e092391e7100cecbe6049799437b26dcfcd8d112e5af</hash><size>29440544</size><sdkver>33</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-07</added><sig>22932c45e84e5c024b008650d2282d97</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC,INTERNET,MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,WAKE_LOCK,com.tlisonbee.mediasync.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION,com.tlisonbee.mediasync.permission.PLAYER</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>1.3.1</version><versioncode>25</versioncode><apkname>mediasync-1.3.1.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">76b10dd3fe3735495da67c50329ba8469b7402298d912e2da474b5bdd254a085</hash><size>29440540</size><sdkver>33</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-05</added><sig>22932c45e84e5c024b008650d2282d97</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC,INTERNET,MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,WAKE_LOCK,com.tlisonbee.mediasync.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION,com.tlisonbee.mediasync.permission.PLAYER</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package></application><application id="com.tlisonbee.segue"><id>com.tlisonbee.segue</id><added>2026-11-05</added><lastupdated>2026-11-05</lastupdated><name>Segue</name><summary>Plays your music files and TIDAL in one queue, and scrobbles to Last.fm</summary><desc>A music player for your own music files, and TIDAL, in one queue.

* &lt;b&gt;Your library:&lt;/b&gt; browse by artist, album, song, folder and playlist, and search. A rescan reads only what changed.
* &lt;b&gt;Playback:&lt;/b&gt; gapless, with FFmpeg's decoders; volume levelling from ReplayGain tags, by track or by album; the media notification, lock screen and Bluetooth controls.
* &lt;b&gt;The queue:&lt;/b&gt; tapping a track plays its album, playlist, folder or search results from that track. Play next, Add to queue, shuffle and repeat. Segue picks up where you left off.
* &lt;b&gt;Playlists:&lt;/b&gt; .m3u8 files in Music/Playlists, which desktop players can read too.
* &lt;b&gt;TIDAL&lt;/b&gt; (needs a subscription): search, your favorites and playlists, playback up to 24-bit FLAC, and editing your playlists and favorites.
* &lt;b&gt;Last.fm:&lt;/b&gt; scrobbling, including scrobbles made offline, and your stats.
* &lt;b&gt;Appearance:&lt;/b&gt; Follow system, Light, Dark or Black, with your wallpaper's colours or one of nine accent colours.
* &lt;b&gt;MediaSync, if you use it:&lt;/b&gt; Segue rescans right after a sync, uses the loudness the server measures, and streams the server's tracks the phone doesn't keep.

Needs &quot;All files access&quot; to read the Music folder.</desc><license>GPL-3.0-or-later</license><categories>Multimedia</categories><category>Multimedia</category><web>https://github.com/tblisonb/Segue</web><source>https://github.com/tblisonb/Segue</source><tracker>https://github.com/tblisonb/Segue/issues</tracker><changelog>https://github.com/tblisonb/Segue/releases</changelog><author>tblisonb</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>10</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeNet</antifeatures><package><version>1.0.0</version><versioncode>10</versioncode><apkname>segue-1.0.0.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">5c1c71f963a6794ef916745fa98affdce8add6d5aa39473ee1a0295cc4466268</hash><size>37736335</size><sdkver>33</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-05</added><sig>22932c45e84e5c024b008650d2282d97</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PLAYBACK,INTERNET,MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,WAKE_LOCK,com.tlisonbee.mediasync.permission.PLAYER,com.tlisonbee.segue.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package></application></fdroid>